  "id": "d164c365-6d2f-4817-899d-3c0c19041fe7",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging. FlowPainter introduces a diffusion-based optical flow framework that reformulates dense-flow generation as confidence-guided soft inpainting, achieving strong accuracy and efficiency by integrating reliable discriminative priors with diffusion refinement.",
